<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 7,646 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 118.78 pence a kilo against 115.81 last week and 106.25 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 206,724 pkgs sold so far this year is 111.77 pence against 100.56 pence for the 302,351 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
